1. DEFINITIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

"Licensor" means Gabriel Barbosa, the sole copyright holder of the Software.

"Software" means the contents of this repository, in source or compiled form,
including the ingestion service, the read API, the background jobs, the
database schemas and migrations, the website, the documentation site, the
shared libraries, the build and infrastructure code, and any package published
from it.

"SDK Packages" means the packages published to the npm registry under the
@nekolog-io scope whose purpose is to be embedded in an application written by
someone else, namely: core, browser, node, react, next, express, fastify,
hono, nestjs, pino, winston, cli and bundler-plugin.

"Service" means the NekoLog service operated by the Licensor.

"Your Application" means software that You develop and operate, or distribute
to Your own end users, which is not itself a logging, observability or
telemetry product or service.

